** ==============================================================================
** ABAQUS/STANDARD THERMO-MECHANICAL MATERIAL CARD: 27MnCr5, PLAIN (NO SDV)
** For the tetrahedral volumes away from the weld (CROWN_TET / CARRIER_TET)
** Units: mm, s, tonne, mJ, MPa, C
** Author: Victor Maia (vhfm08@gmail.com)
**
** Material_27MnCr5.inp without the phase transformation framework: one phase (the
** initial "Ferrite" phase of the card, the as-delivered microstructure), properties
** dependent on temperature only, no *DEPVAR and no *USER DEFINED FIELD.
** Valid while the tets stay below Ac1 = 732 C: there they never transform, and the phase
** framework would only cost its state variables. Check the maximum temperature on
** the hex / tet boundary (CROWN_TET_TIE / CARRIER_TET_TIE) in the results.
